0 Pleurocystidia present 022914170 subgen. Flammuloides (key B) (additional characters: pileus without scales at maturity, in some species with tomentose, floccose or t1occose-scaly veil remnants at margin when young, pleurocystidia of the same shape as the cheilocystidia, lageniform-fusiform or utriform, spores with germ pore)18
