0 Pileus conspicuously brick-red to carrot-red at centre, context turning brown to black when old. taste bitter, spores ovoid to slightly amygdaliform, without germ pore. 0511617270 Pholiota astragalina, pp. 960
0 Pileus not conspicuously brick-red to carrot-red at centre, context not turning brown to black when old05117172806
0 Spores small, (3.7-)4.0--5.0(-5.8) x 2.0--3.0(-3.3) µm , slightly phaseoliform in side view, germ pore absent, pileus dry, bright yellow to orange-yellow, covered with appressed or upturned bright yellow scales, stipe bright yellow, with distinct yellow scales 06171818290 Pholiota flammans, pp. 860
